{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "slide-to-confirm",
  "title": "Slide to confirm",
  "group": "Actions",
  "order": 10,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A track with a knob you drag to the end to confirm a costly step on a touch screen (submit grades, send a payment). The knob follows your finger 1:1, resists past the ends, and commits past 85 % of the way.",
    "id": "Lintasan dengan kenop yang digeser sampai ujung untuk mengonfirmasi langkah mahal di layar sentuh (kirim nilai, kirim pembayaran). Kenop mengikuti jari 1:1, menahan saat melewati ujung, dan terkonfirmasi setelah melewati 85 % lintasan."
  },
  "titleId": "Slide to confirm",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Submit grades",
        "desc": "Drag the knob to the end. Let go before 85 % and it springs home; a quick flick counts its speed. With the keyboard, focus the knob and press Enter.",
        "html": "<div class=\"slide\" data-lds-slide>\n  <span class=\"slide__fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"slide__label\" aria-live=\"polite\">Slide to submit grades</span>\n  <button class=\"slide__knob\" aria-label=\"Slide to submit grades. Press Enter to confirm.\" onpointerenter=\"const s = this.closest('.slide'); if (!s.dataset.wired) { s.dataset.wired = '1'; s.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { s.querySelector('.slide__label').textContent = 'Grades submitted'; }); }\" onfocus=\"const s = this.closest('.slide'); if (!s.dataset.wired) { s.dataset.wired = '1'; s.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { s.querySelector('.slide__label').textContent = 'Grades submitted'; }); }\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_forward</span></button>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"slide\" data-lds-slide id=\"submit-grades\">\n  <span class=\"slide__fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"slide__label\" aria-live=\"polite\">Slide to submit grades</span>\n  <button class=\"slide__knob\" aria-label=\"Slide to submit grades. Press Enter to confirm.\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_forward</span></button>\n</div>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  const s = document.getElementById('submit-grades');\n  s.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { s.querySelector('.slide__label').textContent = 'Grades submitted'; sendGrades(); });\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Under a summary on a phone",
        "desc": "What is being confirmed sits right above the track.",
        "html": "<div class=\"stack\" style=\"--gap: 16px; max-width: 360px;\">\n  <dl class=\"kv-list\" style=\"margin: 0;\">\n    <div class=\"kv\"><dt>Exam fee</dt><dd>Rp 150.000</dd></div>\n    <div class=\"kv\"><dt>Paid from</dt><dd>Campus wallet</dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <div class=\"slide\" data-lds-slide>\n  <span class=\"slide__fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"slide__label\" aria-live=\"polite\">Slide to pay Rp 150.000</span>\n  <button class=\"slide__knob\" aria-label=\"Slide to pay Rp 150.000. Press Enter to confirm.\" onpointerenter=\"const s = this.closest('.slide'); if (!s.dataset.wired) { s.dataset.wired = '1'; s.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { s.querySelector('.slide__label').textContent = 'Payment sent'; }); }\" onfocus=\"const s = this.closest('.slide'); if (!s.dataset.wired) { s.dataset.wired = '1'; s.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { s.querySelector('.slide__label').textContent = 'Payment sent'; }); }\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_forward</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Kirim nilai",
        "desc": "Geser kenop sampai ujung. Lepas sebelum 85 % dan ia memantul pulang; jentikan cepat ikut dihitung kecepatannya. Dengan keyboard, fokuskan kenop lalu tekan Enter.",
        "html": "<div class=\"slide\" data-lds-slide>\n  <span class=\"slide__fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"slide__label\" aria-live=\"polite\">Geser untuk mengirim nilai</span>\n  <button class=\"slide__knob\" aria-label=\"Geser untuk mengirim nilai. Tekan Enter untuk mengonfirmasi.\" onpointerenter=\"const s = this.closest('.slide'); if (!s.dataset.wired) { s.dataset.wired = '1'; s.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { s.querySelector('.slide__label').textContent = 'Nilai terkirim'; }); }\" onfocus=\"const s = this.closest('.slide'); if (!s.dataset.wired) { s.dataset.wired = '1'; s.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { s.querySelector('.slide__label').textContent = 'Nilai terkirim'; }); }\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_forward</span></button>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"slide\" data-lds-slide id=\"submit-grades\">\n  <span class=\"slide__fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"slide__label\" aria-live=\"polite\">Geser untuk mengirim nilai</span>\n  <button class=\"slide__knob\" aria-label=\"Geser untuk mengirim nilai. Tekan Enter untuk mengonfirmasi.\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_forward</span></button>\n</div>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  const s = document.getElementById('submit-grades');\n  s.addEventListener('lds:confirm', () => { s.querySelector('.slide__label').textContent = 'Nilai terkirim'; sendGrades(); });\n</script>"
